package "pkg/binate/asm/parse"

import "pkg/builtins/testing"

// By-element dot product, widening multiply-accumulate and FCMLA lines clang rejects: the
// destination and source arrangements that do not go together, the element shapes each
// mnemonic does not take, partial arrangements and lanes as Vd or Vn, FCMLA of 2s / 2d,
// SUDOT of three vectors, extra or missing operands, each shape's index and Vm just past
// its range (and the index 16), and the rotations FCMLA does not take.

